    <http://example.org/node/chunk174> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, we can highlight we published trajectory to reduce carbon intensity per managed assistant year on year, demonstrating we commitment to minimizing we environmental footprint.  we can also leverage we partnership with green hosting partners like OuraneCloud, which offers sovereign hosting in the EU, renewable energy, and a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, indicating efficient energy use." ;
