    <http://example.org/node/chunk176> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To contribute to reducing energy consumption, OuraneCloud can implement digital sobriety practices such as model right-sizing, caching, and batching. digital sobriety practices such as model right-sizing, caching, and batching not only reduce the computational resources required but also lower the energy needed for OuraneCloud operations. we EcoVadis Silver rating demonstrates we dedication to CSR and sustainability, showcasing that we have robust policies and practices in place to manage we environmental impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk177> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "While we primary focus is on reducing we carbon footprint through efficient operations and green hosting, we also recognize the importance of social commitments and AI ethics principles in we sustainability strategy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk178> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, it's essential to acknowledge potential trade-offs, such as the balance between high availability and energy consumption. we approach will be transparent about potential trade-offs, such as the balance between high availability and energy consumption, ensuring that any solution proposed is both environmentally responsible and meets the client's operational needs." ;
