        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) solution is built on our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that provides fast and accurate responses to queries. our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that provides fast and accurate responses to queries performance metrics indicate a median latency of 1.3 seconds, with common single-document queries being below 2 seconds at p95, meeting the requirement for response times compatible with daily clinical use. our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform that provides fast and accurate responses to queriesegrates with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI) through standard connectors, supporting health interoperability standards (HL7/FHIR). our also provide a FHIR/HL7 connector to enable the exchange of health data in a standardized format." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

