        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk7> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "General description of the need The expected solution must provide hospital staff with an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from hospital staff work environment, capable of supporting hospital staff in hospital staff clinical-administrative activities. an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from their work environment, capable of supporting them in their clinical-administrative activities may notably cover: retrieval of information from internal procedures, care protocols and applicable regulation; assistance in drafting medical and administrative documents; support in handling dossiers (admissions, coding, medico-social pathways, etc.); support for the continuity of care between professionals, shifts and services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk70> a prov:Entity ;
